            <ArticleTitle>Coronary artery vein grafting in a case of Ehlers-Danlos syndrome.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>237-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A 64 year old man with Ehlers-Danlos syndrome type 2 was admitted to hospital with severe angina of effort. Aortocoronary vein grafting was performed successfully.</AbstractText>
